→ work:Backups/Documents   two-way   merge

  The sync state for this destination was lost or damaged. OneFolder will
  merge both sides: files that exist on only one side are copied to the
  other, and where the same file differs the local copy wins (the other copy
  is kept with a .conflict suffix). Nothing is deleted by a merge.
